WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.780
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.050 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.700 --> 01:45.910
[Episode 7]

5
01:46.200 --> 01:47.000
Also,

6
01:48.120 --> 01:50.780
if the killer was so precise with the poisoning,

7
01:51.229 --> 01:52.039
then any poison

8
01:52.039 --> 01:53.229
would have worked.

9
01:53.590 --> 01:55.070
Why choose Corpse-Dissolving Powder,

10
01:55.070 --> 01:56.270
which is so expensive

11
01:56.280 --> 01:58.200
and so easy to trace

12
01:58.200 --> 01:59.350
back to its source?

13
02:01.870 --> 02:03.000
Well,

14
02:03.120 --> 02:03.950
newcomer,

15
02:04.200 --> 02:05.760
that's a sound analysis.

16
02:08.750 --> 02:09.960
Greetings, Lord Constable Iron.

17
02:09.960 --> 02:11.400
-I am— -Then what do you think

18
02:11.400 --> 02:12.310
the reason is?

19
02:18.400 --> 02:19.260
Only the killer

20
02:20.870 --> 02:22.520
knows the answer to that.

21
02:26.560 --> 02:27.360
Alright.

22
02:27.710 --> 02:28.560
Now that Corpse-Dissolving Powder

23
02:28.560 --> 02:29.560
has yielded no clues,

24
02:29.560 --> 02:30.960
let's turn our attention

25
02:30.960 --> 02:32.190
to the black chest.

26
02:33.870 --> 02:35.000
I've heard of this method

27
02:35.000 --> 02:36.600
of issuing murder warnings.

28
02:37.079 --> 02:38.480
Let's wrap things up here

29
02:38.520 --> 02:40.150
and head to the Tianshu Pavilion to look for clues.

30
02:40.150 --> 02:40.840
All right.

31
02:41.910 --> 02:42.710
Lord Lou,

32
02:44.079 --> 02:46.340
may I go with you to the Tianshu Pavilion?

33
02:48.000 --> 02:48.960
Of course...

34
02:49.960 --> 02:50.960
not.

35
02:51.470 --> 02:52.280
Fall in!

36
02:52.280 --> 02:52.960
Let's go.

37
02:59.560 --> 03:00.800
Lady Constable Frost,

38
03:00.800 --> 03:02.750
now that Prince Wenbu's body is gone,

39
03:02.750 --> 03:03.710
what should we do

40
03:03.960 --> 03:05.420
with his bodily fluids...

41
03:05.870 --> 03:06.960
"The wind leaves a sound,

42
03:06.960 --> 03:08.360
and water leaves a trace.

43
03:08.360 --> 03:09.910
Anything that happens

44
03:10.080 --> 03:12.140
is bound to leave something behind."

45
03:12.800 --> 03:14.250
Those were the words of advice and admonition

46
03:14.250 --> 03:14.970
from the Chief

47
03:14.970 --> 03:17.630
on the day I joined the Divine Constable Bureau.

48
03:17.910 --> 03:19.190
But taking all this back

49
03:19.190 --> 03:20.230
with us

50
03:20.710 --> 03:22.240
is going to be quite a chore.

51
03:23.280 --> 03:24.240
A chore

52
03:24.360 --> 03:25.590
is always easier

53
03:25.800 --> 03:27.660
than something mentally taxing.

54
03:29.470 --> 03:30.310
Well said.

55
03:32.400 --> 03:33.710
Very well said.

56
03:33.960 --> 03:35.290
Then I'll leave it to you

57
03:35.480 --> 03:37.040
to take the body back,

58
03:37.160 --> 03:38.290
Trainee Constable.

59
03:39.190 --> 03:39.960
What?

60
03:40.280 --> 03:41.079
Fall in!

61
03:41.079 --> 03:41.800
Yes.

62
03:53.800 --> 03:55.530
Master was right.

63
03:56.530 --> 03:59.460
Why did I have to come to the Divine Constable Bureau?

64
03:59.800 --> 04:02.130
Why did I have to become a constable?

65
04:12.000 --> 04:13.190
Wenbu, oh, Wenbu.

66
04:14.000 --> 04:15.980
I used to be a prince, after all.

67
04:16.600 --> 04:18.660
Now I'm here to collect your remains.

68
04:18.870 --> 04:20.600
You can't complain about that.

69
04:24.190 --> 04:25.600
You really stink.

70
04:35.370 --> 04:37.620
[Tianshu Pavilion]

71
04:55.190 --> 04:56.000
Found it!

72
05:01.190 --> 05:02.190
What did you find?

73
05:04.870 --> 05:06.600
A case file on murder warnings.

74
05:08.310 --> 05:09.190
Is there really a secret art

75
05:09.190 --> 05:11.320
that allows one to foresee the future?

76
05:11.870 --> 05:13.000
According to this record,

77
05:13.000 --> 05:13.920
there was once a peerless martial artist

78
05:13.920 --> 05:15.240
in the jianghu.

79
05:15.310 --> 05:16.920
Whenever he challenged someone to a duel,

80
05:16.920 --> 05:17.830
he would first

81
05:18.000 --> 05:19.920
send them a black chest to announce the killing.

82
05:19.920 --> 05:21.360
He would then kill his opponent

83
05:21.360 --> 05:22.560
using the move depicted inside the black chest,

84
05:22.560 --> 05:23.630
demonstrating

85
05:24.000 --> 05:25.480
his extraordinary martial prowess.

86
05:25.480 --> 05:26.800
If someone's martial arts mastery

87
05:26.800 --> 05:28.200
reaches a certain level,

88
05:28.390 --> 05:29.390
they may indeed be able

89
05:29.390 --> 05:31.590
to anticipate their opponent's moves.

90
05:32.390 --> 05:33.560
What was

91
05:33.560 --> 05:35.690
this peerless martial artist's name?

92
05:39.140 --> 05:39.720
[Divine Constable Bureau] [Netherworld Swordsman Case]

93
05:39.720 --> 05:41.320
The Netherworld Swordsman.

94
05:41.680 --> 05:43.280
The Netherworld Swordsman,

95
05:43.510 --> 05:44.300
Dao Yin.

96
05:45.270 --> 05:47.159
The Netherworld Swordsman?

97
05:47.560 --> 05:48.950
I've never heard of him.

98
05:48.970 --> 05:49.890
Naturally.

99
05:50.560 --> 05:52.920
The Netherworld Swordsman bathed the jianghu in blood

100
05:52.920 --> 05:54.560
more than thirty years ago.

101
05:54.830 --> 05:55.720
You and I

102
05:55.750 --> 05:57.390
were both still young back then.

103
05:57.390 --> 05:58.690
Could this Dao Yin

104
05:58.720 --> 06:00.380
have returned to the jianghu?

105
06:04.070 --> 06:05.030
Mr. Meng,

106
06:05.310 --> 06:06.310
what do you think?

107
06:07.950 --> 06:09.270
I know nothing about poison,

108
06:09.270 --> 06:10.070
nor do I understand

109
06:10.070 --> 06:11.750
the mindset of someone who issues murder warnings.

110
06:11.750 --> 06:13.390
But I do understand swordsmen.

111
06:13.390 --> 06:14.120
If a swordsman

112
06:14.120 --> 06:15.480
uses poison instead of his sword,

113
06:15.480 --> 06:17.210
he is being untrue to the sword.

114
06:17.600 --> 06:19.000
And a swordsman who is untrue to the sword

115
06:19.000 --> 06:21.660
can never reach the pinnacle of swordsmanship.

116
06:23.750 --> 06:24.560
Wait.

117
06:25.160 --> 06:27.010
The Netherworld Swordsman

118
06:27.070 --> 06:30.120
rose to fame thirty years ago.

119
06:31.120 --> 06:32.150
That would make him

120
06:32.150 --> 06:34.070
around 70 or 80 by now, wouldn't it?

121
06:34.070 --> 06:35.200
It's quite possible

122
06:35.560 --> 06:36.900
that the Netherworld Swordsman's successor

123
06:36.900 --> 06:37.790
is still alive.

124
06:38.950 --> 06:40.480
Do you know the name of the weapon

125
06:40.480 --> 06:42.810
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

126
06:43.190 --> 06:44.750
was

127
06:45.390 --> 06:46.390
famous for?

128
06:47.750 --> 06:48.810
What was it called?

129
06:49.480 --> 06:50.360
That was

130
06:51.159 --> 06:52.540
the Severe-Cold Sword.

131
07:03.480 --> 07:05.390
So his name was Dao Yin.

132
07:07.270 --> 07:09.470
I'd like to ask you something, Mr. Meng.

133
07:09.510 --> 07:11.460
What was your master's name,

134
07:11.560 --> 07:13.830
and where is he now?

135
07:19.800 --> 07:21.060
Are you suspecting me?

136
07:21.560 --> 07:22.390
Mr. Meng,

137
07:23.310 --> 07:24.510
there are some questions

138
07:24.510 --> 07:26.040
we need to clarify with you.

139
07:26.190 --> 07:29.120
Would you come with us to the Chief Constable's Hall?

140
07:29.390 --> 07:30.190
Lou,

141
07:30.800 --> 07:32.190
Meng Rui is one of us.

142
07:32.390 --> 07:34.390
How could he possibly be the killer?

143
07:34.480 --> 07:35.720
This concerns diplomatic relations between our two countries.

144
07:35.720 --> 07:36.950
Even if one of our own is involved,

145
07:36.950 --> 07:38.870
we have to investigate thoroughly.

146
07:38.870 --> 07:39.680
It's fine.

147
07:40.480 --> 07:42.000
The innocent have nothing to fear.

148
07:42.000 --> 07:43.200
Hand over your sword.

149
07:50.510 --> 07:51.920
I'll go with you.

150
07:52.950 --> 07:53.810
But I will never

151
07:55.170 --> 07:56.670
surrender my sword.

152
07:56.920 --> 07:57.720
Meng Rui.

153
07:58.270 --> 07:59.610
I'll say it again.

154
07:59.750 --> 08:01.950
As long as I live, my sword stays with me.

155
08:09.310 --> 08:10.640
Let's not get worked up.

156
08:11.120 --> 08:12.360
We're just investigating the case.

157
08:12.360 --> 08:14.120
We'll get to the bottom of it, all right?

158
08:14.120 --> 08:15.250
Under Great Shi law,

159
08:15.510 --> 08:17.160
a suspect must surrender their weapon.

160
08:17.160 --> 08:18.000
Meng Rui,

161
08:18.310 --> 08:19.510
surely you know that.

162
08:19.800 --> 08:21.730
Just because of a name like Dao Yin,

163
08:21.750 --> 08:23.310
you think I'm a suspect?

164
08:23.310 --> 08:24.910
I'm investigating the case.

165
08:25.750 --> 08:27.810
Do you really have something to hide?

166
08:29.000 --> 08:30.160
You can't put it that way.

167
08:30.160 --> 08:32.360
An investigation needs solid evidence.

168
08:32.360 --> 08:34.120
I'm only trying to get to the bottom of this.

169
08:34.120 --> 08:34.909
Do you really think

170
08:34.909 --> 08:36.080
I'd make things difficult for one of my own?

171
08:36.080 --> 08:36.270
I—

172
08:36.270 --> 08:37.669
I'll say it one last time.

173
08:37.669 --> 08:38.870
Hand over your sword.

174
08:51.670 --> 08:52.590
Lou,

175
08:52.750 --> 08:54.210
we're all on the same side.

176
08:54.510 --> 08:56.150
Do me a favor.

177
08:56.390 --> 08:57.520
Don't get worked up.

178
08:57.550 --> 08:58.390
Just stay calm.

179
08:58.390 --> 09:00.650
Why don't you hand him your sword for now?

180
09:06.210 --> 09:07.310
Stop arguing.

181
09:07.870 --> 09:08.870
The Chief is here.

182
09:09.790 --> 09:10.600
Chief.

183
09:16.480 --> 09:17.270
Meng Rui,

184
09:17.750 --> 09:19.030
the Divine Constable Bureau

185
09:19.030 --> 09:19.840
will never

186
09:19.840 --> 09:21.150
let a wrongdoer go free,

187
09:21.150 --> 09:22.370
nor will it wrong

188
09:22.390 --> 09:23.550
an innocent person.

189
09:24.000 --> 09:24.800
Do you trust me

190
09:25.150 --> 09:26.200
on that?

191
09:26.600 --> 09:28.060
I only trust the evidence.

192
09:31.200 --> 09:32.000
Chief,

193
09:32.000 --> 09:32.870
the Divine Constable Bureau has always

194
09:32.870 --> 09:34.550
required solid evidence before taking someone into custody,

195
09:34.550 --> 09:36.950
especially when one of our own is involved.

196
09:40.870 --> 09:42.630
Until the truth comes to light,

197
09:43.200 --> 09:45.600
you will no longer be involved in this case.

198
09:46.390 --> 09:47.360
Effective today,

199
09:47.360 --> 09:49.080
you are to remain confined to Winter's Haven

200
09:49.080 --> 09:50.320
and may not leave without permission.

201
09:50.320 --> 09:51.250
Any objections?

202
09:53.390 --> 09:54.360
None.

203
10:08.730 --> 10:09.630
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

204
10:10.390 --> 10:11.200
Mr. Meng.

205
10:16.860 --> 10:18.340
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

206
10:22.390 --> 10:24.240
Mr. Meng, forgive us.

207
10:26.970 --> 10:29.060
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

208
10:29.960 --> 10:31.160
-Mr. Meng. -Mr. Meng.

209
10:32.320 --> 10:33.120
Mr. Meng?

210
10:36.960 --> 10:37.790
Sirs,

211
10:38.550 --> 10:39.600
are you

212
10:39.960 --> 10:41.360
monitoring Mr. Meng?

213
10:41.360 --> 10:42.360
Trainee Constable,

214
10:42.360 --> 10:44.020
don't ask too many questions.

215
10:48.730 --> 10:50.960
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

216
10:50.960 --> 10:51.720
Mr. Qi.

217
10:51.720 --> 10:52.390
Mr. Li.

218
10:56.600 --> 10:58.600
Are you bringing Mr. Meng some food?

219
10:58.670 --> 10:59.480
Yes.

220
10:59.600 --> 11:01.080
I brought him something to eat.

221
11:01.080 --> 11:02.550
Without the Chief's orders,

222
11:02.550 --> 11:03.510
Mr. Meng isn't even allowed

223
11:03.510 --> 11:04.970
to step outside this door.

224
11:11.480 --> 11:12.270
Mr. Qi,

225
11:12.790 --> 11:13.790
what's really going on

226
11:13.790 --> 11:15.240
with Mr. Meng?

227
11:15.390 --> 11:17.150
I don't know the details.

228
11:17.270 --> 11:18.630
But I heard

229
11:19.270 --> 11:20.600
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

230
11:20.600 --> 11:22.750
is connected to the black chest murder warnings.

231
11:22.750 --> 11:24.950
The Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin...

232
11:25.270 --> 11:26.550
and the black chest murder warnings?

233
11:26.550 --> 11:27.630
And I also heard

234
11:27.870 --> 11:29.600
that the person was his master.

235
11:31.200 --> 11:32.510
His master?

236
11:33.270 --> 11:34.320
This is classified.

237
11:34.320 --> 11:35.650
Don't tell anyone else.

238
11:38.150 --> 11:39.270
I told you, Mr. Meng

239
11:39.270 --> 11:40.330
has a murderous aura about him.

240
11:40.330 --> 11:41.390
If he had nothing going on,

241
11:41.390 --> 11:42.720
why would he be so quiet?

242
11:43.150 --> 11:44.750
I heard no one at Winter's Haven

243
11:44.750 --> 11:46.500
has even touched his sword.

244
11:46.790 --> 11:48.200
If we'd known he was this kind of person, we should have been

245
11:48.200 --> 11:50.360
-more cautious around him from the start. -Mr. Qi,

246
11:50.360 --> 11:51.620
believe it or not,

247
11:51.960 --> 11:53.000
by tomorrow,

248
11:53.390 --> 11:54.270
this won't be

249
11:54.270 --> 11:55.390
a secret anymore.

250
11:55.960 --> 11:56.790
By then,

251
11:57.550 --> 11:59.000
the whole Tianhuang City

252
11:59.270 --> 12:00.550
might know about it.

253
12:18.000 --> 12:20.010
Sometimes I wonder,

254
12:20.150 --> 12:22.120
doesn't he get sore

255
12:22.390 --> 12:24.390
just sitting there without moving?

256
12:24.600 --> 12:25.510
Mr. Meng,

257
12:26.320 --> 12:27.290
I can understand

258
12:27.600 --> 12:29.460
how you feel

259
12:29.790 --> 12:31.720
about being treated as the killer.

260
12:32.150 --> 12:33.150
Think about it.

261
12:33.870 --> 12:35.480
When we first met,

262
12:35.910 --> 12:37.600
didn't you suspect me too?

263
12:37.870 --> 12:38.800
It's no big deal.

264
12:46.150 --> 12:47.120
Sirs,

265
12:47.960 --> 12:49.910
Mr. Meng isn't even a suspect yet.

266
12:49.960 --> 12:51.550
There's no need to blow this out of proportion.

267
12:51.550 --> 12:52.600
Think about it.

268
12:52.720 --> 12:53.720
The killer

269
12:54.320 --> 12:56.240
would have to be capable

270
12:56.390 --> 12:58.480
of crafting one of those exquisitely intricate black chests,

271
12:58.480 --> 12:59.270
right?

272
12:59.960 --> 13:01.240
Now look at Mr. Meng.

273
13:01.720 --> 13:03.960
With those sword-wielding hands of his,

274
13:03.960 --> 13:05.000
he'd have a hard time

275
13:05.000 --> 13:06.790
even weaving a scabbard out of Dragon-whisker Grass.

276
13:06.790 --> 13:07.750
Let alone

277
13:07.960 --> 13:09.820
making one of those black chests.

278
13:10.720 --> 13:11.960
When we investigated the case yesterday,

279
13:11.960 --> 13:13.150
I observed you.

280
13:15.270 --> 13:16.600
With your unconventional ideas

281
13:16.600 --> 13:18.060
and unorthodox approach,

282
13:18.080 --> 13:19.600
you always manage to make discoveries

283
13:19.600 --> 13:21.330
in the most unexpected places.

284
13:21.390 --> 13:23.450
Sounds good. I like what I'm hearing.

285
13:24.080 --> 13:26.360
If you're going to flatter me, keep it coming.

286
13:26.360 --> 13:27.510
Someone like you,

287
13:28.120 --> 13:30.150
choosing to be just a trainee constable...

288
13:30.150 --> 13:32.410
You must have some other purpose in mind.

289
13:33.790 --> 13:34.630
Mr. Meng,

290
13:36.320 --> 13:38.150
you're in trouble yourself now.

291
13:38.510 --> 13:40.970
Maybe you should worry more about yourself.

292
13:48.480 --> 13:49.340
Think about it.

293
13:50.270 --> 13:51.600
A prince of Northern Kun

294
13:51.600 --> 13:53.810
was killed within Great Shi's borders.

295
13:54.030 --> 13:54.970
My guess

296
13:55.150 --> 13:56.790
is that someone wants to use this

297
13:56.790 --> 13:58.510
to provoke a war between the two countries

298
13:58.510 --> 14:00.040
and make you the scapegoat.

299
14:01.480 --> 14:02.740
You really believe me?

300
14:03.390 --> 14:04.150
I do.

301
14:05.390 --> 14:06.960
You're upright and straightforward by nature.

302
14:06.960 --> 14:08.620
You could never be the killer.

303
14:10.670 --> 14:12.200
You can believe in me all you want,

304
14:12.200 --> 14:13.600
but I still suspect you.

305
14:13.790 --> 14:14.870
You can have your suspicions,

306
14:14.870 --> 14:16.200
and I'll keep believing in you.

307
14:16.200 --> 14:17.000
Either way,

308
14:17.360 --> 14:19.420
I'll get to the bottom of this for you.

309
14:20.150 --> 14:21.630
No need. Please leave.

310
14:25.200 --> 14:26.130
Unfortunately,

311
14:26.650 --> 14:27.770
this is the area

312
14:28.320 --> 14:30.050
I'm responsible for cleaning.

313
14:31.300 --> 14:31.790
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

314
14:31.790 --> 14:32.600
All right, that's enough.

315
14:32.600 --> 14:34.660
Everyone, go back and get some sleep.

316
14:34.790 --> 14:36.080
Don't worry. With me here,

317
14:36.080 --> 14:37.080
he's not going anywhere.

318
14:37.080 --> 14:38.870
Now get back and have some sleep.

319
14:38.870 --> 14:39.730
Go on, go to bed.

320
14:39.790 --> 14:40.600
Go now! Go!

321
14:40.720 --> 14:41.580
Get some sleep.

322
14:43.120 --> 14:45.520
-Constable Frost. -Lady Constable Frost.

323
14:47.150 --> 14:48.410
Lady Constable Frost.

324
14:49.960 --> 14:50.670
Yan,

325
14:50.670 --> 14:52.930
I came to bring Meng Rui something to eat.

326
14:58.600 --> 14:59.360
Give it to me.

327
14:59.360 --> 15:00.150
I'll take it

328
15:00.200 --> 15:01.150
inside later.

329
15:01.670 --> 15:03.200
Even if you gave it to him right now,

330
15:03.200 --> 15:04.390
he wouldn't feel like eating.

331
15:04.390 --> 15:09.610
[Divine Constable Bureau]

332
15:13.630 --> 15:14.440
Meng Rui!

333
15:15.510 --> 15:16.750
A life for a life!

334
15:17.240 --> 15:18.200
Come out!

335
15:19.440 --> 15:20.360
Come out!

336
15:22.590 --> 15:23.080
[Divine Constable Bureau]

337
15:23.080 --> 15:23.870
Meng Rui,

338
15:24.760 --> 15:25.560
did you

339
15:25.580 --> 15:27.250
kill Prince Wenbu

340
15:27.900 --> 15:30.160
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

341
15:30.270 --> 15:31.390
Is that so?

342
15:31.870 --> 15:32.750
Meng Rui,

343
15:33.790 --> 15:35.510
you coward,

344
15:36.050 --> 15:38.030
will you face me in a fight to the death,

345
15:38.030 --> 15:39.930
as a man of the jianghu should?

346
15:40.360 --> 15:41.750
Two hours from now,

347
15:41.940 --> 15:42.150
[Divine Constable Bureau]

348
15:42.150 --> 15:43.320
I'll be waiting for you

349
15:43.320 --> 15:45.360
at Knife-Edge Ridge on Mount Dahuang.

350
15:45.360 --> 15:46.600
If you don't show up,

351
15:47.120 --> 15:48.450
all you need to do

352
15:49.440 --> 15:52.030
is admit that the Netherworld Swordsman was a fraud

353
15:52.030 --> 15:53.320
and that the Four Divine Constables

354
15:53.320 --> 15:55.240
are a bunch of spineless cowards.

355
15:58.030 --> 15:58.750
Mr. Meng.

356
15:58.750 --> 15:59.480
Mr. Meng.

357
15:59.480 --> 15:59.910
Meng Rui!

358
15:59.910 --> 16:00.840
Don't act rashly.

359
16:00.840 --> 16:01.870
Yan Zige is trying to provoke you.

360
16:01.870 --> 16:03.120
Yes, if you don't go, you can still clear things up.

361
16:03.120 --> 16:04.120
But if you go, you'll only make yourself look more suspicious.

362
16:04.120 --> 16:05.080
Don't go, Mr. Meng.

363
16:05.080 --> 16:06.080
The Chief is here.

364
16:10.840 --> 16:11.770
-Chief. -Chief.

365
16:18.550 --> 16:19.510
Could it be...

366
16:19.840 --> 16:20.750
Just now,

367
16:21.240 --> 16:22.500
the second black chest

368
16:22.510 --> 16:25.040
was delivered to the Chief Constable's Hall.

369
16:25.440 --> 16:26.240
Chief,

370
16:26.360 --> 16:27.080
Meng Rui has been confined

371
16:27.080 --> 16:28.870
to Winter's Haven all this time.

372
16:28.870 --> 16:29.550
Can that show

373
16:29.550 --> 16:30.950
that he isn't the killer?

374
16:30.960 --> 16:32.720
Meng Rui was alone at Winter's Haven.

375
16:32.720 --> 16:34.150
Who can vouch for him?

376
16:35.320 --> 16:36.550
With Meng Rui's skills,

377
16:36.550 --> 16:38.150
delivering a chest to my room

378
16:38.150 --> 16:39.960
and returning to Winter's Haven

379
16:40.270 --> 16:41.470
would be effortless.

380
16:42.960 --> 16:43.750
Open it.

381
16:43.750 --> 16:44.440
Yes.

382
17:21.920 --> 17:23.849
This is the second murder warning.

383
17:24.030 --> 17:25.359
Could these two figures

384
17:25.680 --> 17:27.349
be Meng Rui and Yan Zige?

385
17:30.510 --> 17:32.200
In that case, I'll go.

386
17:32.430 --> 17:33.350
Taking the initiative

387
17:33.350 --> 17:34.210
might help us make a breakthrough

388
17:34.210 --> 17:35.100
in the case.

389
17:35.240 --> 17:36.030
You can't go.

390
17:36.070 --> 17:36.880
Meng Rui,

391
17:37.270 --> 17:38.730
if you're truly innocent,

392
17:38.750 --> 17:39.550
going there means

393
17:39.550 --> 17:40.830
falling right into their trap.

394
17:40.830 --> 17:42.270
That's right. Listen, everyone.

395
17:42.270 --> 17:43.600
Yan Zige has gone quiet.

396
17:43.680 --> 17:44.350
He must be afraid

397
17:44.350 --> 17:45.510
of your Severe-Cold Sword.

398
17:45.510 --> 17:47.030
He got tired of shouting and quietly went back.

399
17:47.030 --> 17:47.920
Ignore him.

400
17:48.110 --> 17:49.110
Reporting!

401
17:50.750 --> 17:51.550
Chief,

402
17:51.680 --> 17:52.550
Yan Zige of Northern Kun

403
17:52.550 --> 17:53.510
has abducted Qi

404
17:53.510 --> 17:54.920
and injured several of our men.

405
17:54.920 --> 17:55.750
What?

406
17:55.780 --> 17:58.110
He dared lay a hand on someone from the Divine Constable Bureau?

407
17:58.110 --> 17:59.920
Even as an envoy of Northern Kun,

408
18:00.000 --> 18:00.750
he can't get away

409
18:00.750 --> 18:03.750
with causing trouble at the Divine Constable Bureau!

410
18:07.680 --> 18:08.680
Where's Meng Rui?

411
18:12.480 --> 18:14.210
Qi must be rescued safely,

412
18:14.270 --> 18:15.200
but remember,

413
18:15.310 --> 18:16.470
more importantly,

414
18:16.540 --> 18:17.880
we must not let the second

415
18:17.880 --> 18:19.340
murder warning come true.

416
18:19.350 --> 18:20.110
-Yes. -Yes.

417
18:20.200 --> 18:21.000
Move out!

418
18:21.110 --> 18:21.920
Let's go.

419
18:24.640 --> 18:25.550
Chief,

420
18:27.880 --> 18:29.960
may I come with you?

421
18:30.310 --> 18:31.350
If I don't allow it,

422
18:31.350 --> 18:32.550
will you stay behind?

423
18:34.880 --> 18:36.720
After all, you're only an auxiliary constable,

424
18:36.720 --> 18:38.480
so your status isn't appropriate for this.

425
18:38.480 --> 18:39.640
Change into some civilian clothes

426
18:39.640 --> 18:41.640
and act according to the situation.

427
18:42.030 --> 18:42.830
Yes.

428
19:02.920 --> 19:03.880
Chief,

429
19:03.960 --> 19:05.480
so Meng Rui

430
19:05.640 --> 19:07.190
killed Prince Wenbu

431
19:07.270 --> 19:09.350
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

432
19:09.350 --> 19:10.680
Could it be that the Netherworld Swordsman

433
19:10.680 --> 19:12.240
had a grudge against Northern Kun?

434
19:12.240 --> 19:13.260
Thirty years ago,

435
19:13.350 --> 19:16.160
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin, challenged all under heaven.

436
19:16.160 --> 19:17.440
Many martial arts masters

437
19:17.440 --> 19:18.830
from both Great Shi and Northern Kun

438
19:18.830 --> 19:19.830
fell at his hands.

439
19:20.350 --> 19:21.680
His arrogance

440
19:21.680 --> 19:23.350
shook the courts and jianghu of both countries.

441
19:23.350 --> 19:24.200
In the end,

442
19:24.270 --> 19:26.310
Northern Kun was forced to join forces with Great Shi

443
19:26.310 --> 19:27.110
and Grand Secretary Bai

444
19:27.110 --> 19:28.980
to issue a kill order.

445
19:29.960 --> 19:31.510
Dao Yin fought over 100 martial arts masters

446
19:31.510 --> 19:33.800
from both countries, one after another,

447
19:34.270 --> 19:36.920
as the imperial court and the jianghu joined forces to hunt him down.

448
19:36.920 --> 19:37.750
That battle

449
19:37.980 --> 19:39.830
was a bloodbath.

450
20:14.880 --> 20:16.070
Thirty years ago,

451
20:16.750 --> 20:18.480
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

452
20:18.480 --> 20:20.400
was surrounded by martial arts masters

453
20:20.400 --> 20:21.480
from Northern Kun and Great Shi

454
20:21.480 --> 20:23.270
right here at Knife-Edge Ridge.

455
20:23.270 --> 20:25.270
After three days and three nights of fierce fighting,

456
20:25.270 --> 20:28.000
they finally knocked him off the cliff,

457
20:28.070 --> 20:29.550
and he vanished without a trace.

458
20:29.550 --> 20:31.070
Since he passed the Severe-Cold Sword

459
20:31.070 --> 20:32.240
on to you,

460
20:32.640 --> 20:34.500
that means he survived back then.

461
20:34.830 --> 20:35.680
Is he

462
20:36.640 --> 20:37.790
still alive now?

463
20:40.070 --> 20:41.400
None of your business.

464
20:50.110 --> 20:51.110
You're not fighting back?

465
20:51.110 --> 20:52.530
Yan Zige, listen to me.

466
20:52.750 --> 20:53.720
The second black chest murder warning

467
20:53.720 --> 20:54.510
has already been issued.

468
20:54.510 --> 20:55.350
What's depicted inside

469
20:55.350 --> 20:56.830
is exactly what's happening here.

470
20:56.830 --> 20:57.750
If I strike,

471
20:57.750 --> 20:59.240
I'll be falling right into their trap.

472
20:59.240 --> 21:00.070
Enough talk.

473
21:00.920 --> 21:02.790
I'll make you draw your sword.

474
21:11.510 --> 21:12.310
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao,

475
21:12.310 --> 21:14.640
set up the Heaven's Net and Earth's Snare!

476
21:29.830 --> 21:30.640
Thank you.

477
21:51.030 --> 21:52.880
Yan Zige's every move is aimed at killing.

478
21:52.880 --> 21:55.210
Meng Rui, don't get caught up in the fight!

479
22:10.030 --> 22:11.310
Meng Rui, don't!

480
22:32.880 --> 22:33.680
How is he?

481
22:35.240 --> 22:36.200
He's dead.

482
22:38.350 --> 22:39.160
Meng Rui,

483
22:39.440 --> 22:40.640
what have you done?

484
22:40.720 --> 22:41.930
I didn't kill him.

485
22:42.160 --> 22:42.880
I only used 30% of my strength

486
22:42.880 --> 22:43.920
in that last strike.

487
22:43.920 --> 22:44.350
How could I have killed him

488
22:44.350 --> 22:45.590
with one blow?

489
22:49.640 --> 22:50.480
Soliders,

490
22:50.680 --> 22:52.030
seize the killer, Meng Rui!

491
22:52.030 --> 22:52.880
Lord Xiao,

492
22:53.030 --> 22:54.440
how can someone from the Divine Constable Bureau

493
22:54.440 --> 22:55.770
be tried by the Ministry of Justice?

494
22:55.770 --> 22:56.200
[Xiao Ning, Vice Minister of Justice]

495
22:56.200 --> 22:57.310
A life for a life.

496
22:57.480 --> 22:58.310
Does the Divine Constable Bureau think

497
22:58.310 --> 22:59.920
it can disregard the laws of the imperial court?

498
22:59.920 --> 23:01.320
I didn't kill him.

499
23:01.440 --> 23:02.920
How can you say we disregarded the law?

500
23:02.920 --> 23:03.720
Mr. Meng.

501
23:03.880 --> 23:04.720
Lord Xiao.

502
23:05.070 --> 23:06.400
Yan Zige held me hostage.

503
23:06.400 --> 23:08.060
Mr. Meng was trying to save me.

504
23:08.070 --> 23:09.880
I'm sorry, Mr. Meng.

505
23:13.030 --> 23:14.050
The Ministry of Justice and the Divine Constable Bureau

506
23:14.050 --> 23:15.240
have never gotten along.

507
23:15.240 --> 23:17.680
They've been looking for an excuse to cause trouble.

508
23:17.680 --> 23:19.200
Now that Yan Zige is dead,

509
23:19.310 --> 23:21.370
they've finally found their chance.

510
23:21.640 --> 23:23.830
If you let them take you in just like that,

511
23:23.830 --> 23:25.890
don't expect to come out in one piece.

512
23:27.070 --> 23:28.000
Lord Xiao,

513
23:28.000 --> 23:30.200
the Divine Constable Bureau has always upheld strict laws.

514
23:30.200 --> 23:31.790
Once the truth is established,

515
23:31.790 --> 23:33.270
if Meng Rui did kill someone,

516
23:33.270 --> 23:34.160
I will personally

517
23:34.160 --> 23:35.640
hand him over to the Ministry of Justice for punishment.

518
23:35.640 --> 23:37.200
Meng Rui killed a man

519
23:37.200 --> 23:38.030
in full view of everyone.

520
23:38.030 --> 23:39.030
That's the truth.

521
23:39.030 --> 23:39.830
Meng Rui,

522
23:39.920 --> 23:41.310
surrender your sword

523
23:41.310 --> 23:42.240
and submit to arrest at once.

524
23:42.240 --> 23:43.890
If you resist arrest with your martial arts...

525
23:43.890 --> 23:45.620
Sever the tendons in his hands.

526
23:46.880 --> 23:47.920
The interrogation hasn't even begun,

527
23:47.920 --> 23:49.000
and the evidence isn't conclusive.

528
23:49.000 --> 23:50.110
How can you resort to torture?

529
23:50.110 --> 23:51.960
Who among you dares lay a hand on him?

530
23:51.960 --> 23:52.750
Yan Cheng.

531
24:00.440 --> 24:01.700
Why are you still here?

532
24:03.880 --> 24:04.680
Go!

533
24:08.680 --> 24:09.480
Seize him!

534
24:10.080 --> 24:12.190
Meng Rui, how dare you escape!

535
24:41.400 --> 24:44.000
How dare you aid and abet the escape of a prisoner!

536
24:44.000 --> 24:44.790
My Lord,

537
24:46.000 --> 24:49.200
this Thousand-Mechanism Formation requires great precision.

538
24:49.200 --> 24:50.110
Keep

539
24:50.110 --> 24:51.560
yelling at me,

540
24:51.830 --> 24:53.350
and I might make a mistake.

541
25:03.660 --> 25:07.180
[Sucheng, Border of the Great Shi]

542
25:09.790 --> 25:10.650
Your Highness.

543
25:11.750 --> 25:12.680
Third Prince,

544
25:12.720 --> 25:13.680
we're outnumbered.

545
25:13.680 --> 25:14.740
We should retreat.

546
25:18.030 --> 25:19.070
If Sucheng falls,

547
25:19.770 --> 25:20.270
[Zhou Zhu, Prince Ping, Third Prince of the Great Shi]

548
25:20.270 --> 25:22.720
there will be no stronghold left on Great Shi's northern frontier.

549
25:22.720 --> 25:23.720
Tianhuang City

550
25:24.180 --> 25:25.510
will be in grave danger.

551
25:25.620 --> 25:25.680
[Great Shi]

552
25:25.680 --> 25:26.550
Soldiers,

553
25:26.880 --> 25:28.070
defend Sucheng.

554
25:28.590 --> 25:29.830
We swear to fight to the death and never retreat!

555
25:29.830 --> 25:31.680
We swear to fight to the death and never retreat!

556
25:31.680 --> 25:34.340
We swear to fight to the death and never retreat!

557
25:46.310 --> 25:49.070
Even if we seek peace now, I'm afraid it's too late.

558
25:49.070 --> 25:51.070
It seems this won't end peacefully.

559
25:56.110 --> 25:56.920
Your Majesty,

560
25:58.310 --> 26:00.570
Northern Kun has been attacking Sucheng

561
26:00.720 --> 26:02.830
for three days straight over Wenbu's death.

562
26:02.830 --> 26:04.310
Prince Ping may be a formidable warrior,

563
26:04.310 --> 26:05.680
but the enemy outnumbers our forces

564
26:05.680 --> 26:07.030
several times over.

565
26:07.030 --> 26:07.750
I'm afraid

566
26:08.310 --> 26:09.510
Sucheng may not hold.

567
26:10.110 --> 26:11.830
The people of Northern Kun have been demanding

568
26:11.830 --> 26:13.440
that we hand over the murderer, Meng Rui.

569
26:13.440 --> 26:15.270
It seems the crisis on the northern frontier

570
26:15.270 --> 26:16.670
won't be resolved as long

571
26:16.680 --> 26:18.280
as Meng Rui remains at large.

572
26:18.590 --> 26:20.790
I agree with what my elder brother said.

573
26:21.160 --> 26:21.960
Your Majesty,

574
26:22.440 --> 26:23.830
I second his proposal.

575
26:23.920 --> 26:24.720
It's quite rare

576
26:24.720 --> 26:26.350
for the two of you

577
26:28.070 --> 26:29.270
to agree for once.

578
26:34.510 --> 26:36.200
I have one more matter to report.

579
26:36.200 --> 26:38.030
According to Xiao Ning of the Ministry of Justice,

580
26:38.030 --> 26:40.270
Meng Rui had already surrendered.

581
26:40.270 --> 26:41.590
But Li Si,

582
26:41.590 --> 26:43.200
a trainee constable of the Divine Constable Bureau,

583
26:43.200 --> 26:44.510
bent the law for personal reasons and deliberately

584
26:44.510 --> 26:46.440
obstructed the Ministry of Justice from taking Meng Rui into custody,

585
26:46.440 --> 26:47.830
allowing him to escape.

586
26:49.070 --> 26:51.790
I ask that Your Majesty punish Li Si severely.

587
26:52.070 --> 26:52.880
Your Majesty,

588
26:53.070 --> 26:54.640
from what I understand,

589
26:54.830 --> 26:56.760
Li Si had already subdued Meng Rui.

590
26:57.000 --> 26:59.070
It was Xiao Ning of the Ministry of Justice

591
26:59.070 --> 27:00.340
who failed to do his job

592
27:00.440 --> 27:01.590
and held things up,

593
27:01.830 --> 27:03.400
allowing Meng Rui to escape.

594
27:03.400 --> 27:05.070
I ask that Your Majesty hold him accountable.

595
27:05.070 --> 27:06.310
Crown Prince, your words

596
27:06.310 --> 27:07.640
clearly suggest an attempt to shield someone.

597
27:07.640 --> 27:08.880
Isn't that trainee constable Li Si

598
27:08.880 --> 27:09.790
one of your men?

599
27:09.790 --> 27:10.510
Brother,

600
27:10.720 --> 27:11.830
at a time like this,

601
27:12.030 --> 27:13.440
before His Majesty

602
27:13.590 --> 27:15.270
and when it comes to matters of state,

603
27:15.270 --> 27:16.640
why are we still talking about what's yours and what's mine?

604
27:16.640 --> 27:17.440
Your Majesty,

605
27:17.640 --> 27:18.510
I believe

606
27:18.510 --> 27:19.680
our most urgent task

607
27:19.680 --> 27:21.270
is to capture Meng Rui and bring him to justice.

608
27:21.270 --> 27:22.510
Even if Li Si is guilty,

609
27:22.510 --> 27:24.640
he should be allowed to atone through meritorious service.

610
27:24.640 --> 27:25.900
I ask Your Majesty to decide.

611
27:25.900 --> 27:26.720
Your Majesty,

612
27:26.830 --> 27:28.480
the Divine Constable Bureau is suspected of showing favoritism.

613
27:28.480 --> 27:29.400
Why not

614
27:29.400 --> 27:30.790
have the Ministry of Justice handle this case entirely?

615
27:30.790 --> 27:31.270
Your Majesty.

616
27:31.270 --> 27:32.070
Enough.

617
27:36.070 --> 27:38.870
Issue a warrant for Meng Rui throughout the realm.

618
27:39.680 --> 27:42.880
We'll bring Meng Rui in first and deal with the rest later.

619
27:43.680 --> 27:44.680
Both the First Prince and the Crown Prince

620
27:44.680 --> 27:45.830
have a point.

621
27:46.000 --> 27:46.860
How about this:

622
27:47.830 --> 27:49.400
the Ministry of Justice will work together with the Divine Constable Bureau

623
27:49.400 --> 27:50.510
to hunt him down.

624
27:51.200 --> 27:52.000
For this case,

625
27:52.680 --> 27:53.830
the Ministry of Justice need not be subject

626
27:53.830 --> 27:56.070
to the Divine Constable Bureau's authority.

627
27:56.070 --> 27:57.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

628
28:08.070 --> 28:08.920
Strange.

629
28:09.070 --> 28:09.790
Yan Zige did indeed

630
28:09.790 --> 28:11.400
die from a ruptured heart meridian,

631
28:11.400 --> 28:13.680
but his ribs are completely intact.

632
28:16.920 --> 28:18.120
Where is Li Qingyang?

633
28:18.200 --> 28:19.530
Tell him to get out here.

634
28:22.110 --> 28:23.160
We at Star-Gathering Pavilion

635
28:23.160 --> 28:25.170
run a clean and lawful business.

636
28:25.350 --> 28:27.400
Even officials from the Ministry of Justice

637
28:27.400 --> 28:29.400
can't be this overbearing.

638
28:29.400 --> 28:30.890
Sharp tongue.

639
28:31.000 --> 28:32.200
If I don't teach you a lesson...

640
28:32.200 --> 28:33.640
This lady is right.

641
28:34.790 --> 28:35.550
Lord Xiao,

642
28:35.550 --> 28:37.160
you represent the imperial court.

643
28:37.160 --> 28:38.830
You should conduct yourself properly

644
28:38.830 --> 28:40.000
and treat people with courtesy.

645
28:40.000 --> 28:41.000
Only then

646
28:41.020 --> 28:43.000
will the people of Great Shi respect

647
28:43.000 --> 28:43.830
and trust you.

648
28:45.310 --> 28:46.440
Yes, Your Highness.

649
28:46.640 --> 28:48.440
And who might this gentleman be?

650
28:48.830 --> 28:50.640
His Highness Prince Ding is here.

651
28:50.640 --> 28:52.900
Have Li Qingyang come out to receive him.

652
28:58.070 --> 28:58.880
Get up.

653
29:13.240 --> 29:16.000
I, Li Qingyang, pay my respects, Your Highness.

654
29:17.200 --> 29:18.240
Why aren't you kneeling

655
29:18.240 --> 29:19.640
before the First Prince?

656
29:26.110 --> 29:27.750
The First Prince's reputation as a wise prince

657
29:27.750 --> 29:29.150
is renowned far and wide.

658
29:29.440 --> 29:31.240
I'm so honored to meet you today

659
29:31.550 --> 29:33.350
that I was beside myself with joy

660
29:33.350 --> 29:34.680
and forgot my manners.

661
29:35.030 --> 29:36.200
Please forgive me.

662
29:37.590 --> 29:39.190
I am Li Si, a humble commoner.

663
29:39.310 --> 29:40.110
I pay my—

664
29:40.550 --> 29:42.240
Young Master Qingyang, there's no need for such formalities.

665
29:42.240 --> 29:43.030
But

666
29:43.920 --> 29:44.720
have we

667
29:45.200 --> 29:46.880
met somewhere before?

668
29:49.030 --> 29:50.560
I have an unremarkable face

669
29:50.720 --> 29:52.440
and am easily mistaken for others.

670
29:52.440 --> 29:53.240
Perhaps

671
29:54.200 --> 29:56.400
Your Highness remembers incorrectly.

672
29:59.160 --> 30:00.220
I heard

673
30:00.830 --> 30:01.960
the murderer, Meng Rui,

674
30:01.960 --> 30:02.830
was about

675
30:02.830 --> 30:04.330
to be taken into custody,

676
30:05.110 --> 30:06.350
yet for some reason,

677
30:06.790 --> 30:08.510
you let him go.

678
30:12.550 --> 30:13.920
Your Highness,

679
30:15.440 --> 30:17.500
are you here to investigate the case?

680
30:19.240 --> 30:20.920
If you're here on official business,

681
30:20.920 --> 30:23.350
then as a member of the Divine Constable Bureau,

682
30:23.350 --> 30:24.960
it's my duty to ask Your Highness:

683
30:24.960 --> 30:26.750
will our conversation today

684
30:27.510 --> 30:29.350
be entered into the official record?

685
30:29.350 --> 30:30.200
Insolent!

686
30:31.110 --> 30:31.970
Your Highness,

687
30:32.640 --> 30:34.440
Dao Yin's sword trial across the world

688
30:34.440 --> 30:36.160
was thirty years ago.

689
30:36.200 --> 30:37.640
Isn't it a bit biased

690
30:37.790 --> 30:39.310
to infer Meng Rui's motive for murder

691
30:39.310 --> 30:41.620
was to avenge his master

692
30:42.200 --> 30:43.920
based on a single black chest?

693
30:44.030 --> 30:45.880
If we're talking motive alone,

694
30:45.960 --> 30:47.330
no one is more suspicious

695
30:47.330 --> 30:49.070
than him right now.

696
30:50.590 --> 30:51.590
Not necessarily.

697
30:51.960 --> 30:54.000
With the Northern Kun army massing at the border,

698
30:54.000 --> 30:55.240
the court has no choice but

699
30:55.240 --> 30:57.030
to send veteran ministers and seasoned generals

700
30:57.030 --> 30:58.730
to defend the frontier.

701
30:58.920 --> 31:00.200
That means every military officer,

702
31:00.200 --> 31:01.000
whether stationed here

703
31:01.000 --> 31:02.570
in Tianhuang City

704
31:02.960 --> 31:04.510
or sent to the frontier

705
31:04.640 --> 31:06.520
to fight Northern Kun,

706
31:06.590 --> 31:07.350
has a chance

707
31:07.350 --> 31:09.070
to earn merit and advance.

708
31:09.240 --> 31:10.350
If we're talking motives,

709
31:10.350 --> 31:11.830
the Ministry of War has one too.

710
31:11.830 --> 31:13.360
And wouldn't Your Highness

711
31:13.700 --> 31:15.200
have an even stronger motive?

712
31:15.200 --> 31:16.000
You—

713
31:17.550 --> 31:18.440
The Ministry of War

714
31:18.440 --> 31:20.270
has long been beyond my control.

715
31:20.440 --> 31:21.900
How can you conclude

716
31:22.030 --> 31:23.440
that Meng Rui is the murderer

717
31:23.440 --> 31:26.350
based on motive alone?

718
31:32.590 --> 31:34.120
So, Young Master Qingyang,

719
31:34.200 --> 31:35.980
you're quite the debater.

720
31:36.000 --> 31:37.170
In that case,

721
31:37.440 --> 31:38.970
I won't keep you any longer.

722
31:39.830 --> 31:42.200
But let me tell you this:

723
31:42.200 --> 31:44.440
as a member of the Divine Constable Bureau,

724
31:44.440 --> 31:46.310
I hope you uphold the law and remain impartial.

725
31:46.310 --> 31:48.840
If you abuse your position to shield someone,

726
31:49.240 --> 31:52.550
even the Crown Prince won't be able to protect you.

727
31:54.640 --> 31:56.040
What I want to say is this:

728
31:57.790 --> 31:59.400
now that I have joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

729
31:59.400 --> 32:00.790
I will never wrong

730
32:00.790 --> 32:02.720
an innocent person,

731
32:02.920 --> 32:03.960
nor will I ever

732
32:03.960 --> 32:05.620
let a single murderer go free,

733
32:05.640 --> 32:07.200
even if that murderer

734
32:08.920 --> 32:11.110
has evaded justice for years.

735
32:14.920 --> 32:15.720
Good.

736
32:17.550 --> 32:18.750
Very good.

737
32:21.000 --> 32:21.790
Let's go.

738
32:28.880 --> 32:29.680
Jin Se.

739
32:32.270 --> 32:33.070
Master.

740
32:33.110 --> 32:34.640
What the First Prince said just now

741
32:34.640 --> 32:36.100
reminded me of something.

742
32:37.030 --> 32:38.240
Seventeen years ago,

743
32:38.510 --> 32:39.270
the Ministry of War

744
32:39.270 --> 32:41.800
was indeed under the First Prince's control.

745
32:42.550 --> 32:44.750
I need you to look into something for me.

746
32:45.440 --> 32:47.000
Around the ninth day of the second month

747
32:47.000 --> 32:48.530
of the 20th year of Hongyun,

748
32:48.960 --> 32:50.550
did any urgent military reports from the Ministry of War

749
32:50.550 --> 32:51.610
reach the Emperor?

750
32:52.400 --> 32:53.640
If so,

751
32:54.240 --> 32:55.370
I want a complete list of all personnel transfers

752
32:55.370 --> 32:56.440
and all promotions, demotions, rewards, and punishments

753
32:56.440 --> 32:59.200
in the Ministry of War before and after that period.

754
32:59.200 --> 33:00.000
Yes.

755
33:08.440 --> 33:09.500
-Master. -Master.

756
33:10.830 --> 33:12.200
Everyone, leave for now.

757
33:12.200 --> 33:13.000
-Yes. -Yes.

758
33:15.720 --> 33:17.480
This 200,000 taels in banknotes

759
33:17.480 --> 33:18.680
is a token of my respect

760
33:18.680 --> 33:19.920
for the Crown Prince.

761
33:19.920 --> 33:22.350
Eunuch Zhao, I'd appreciate it if you could deliver it to His Highness.

762
33:22.350 --> 33:23.310
Li Qingyang,

763
33:24.350 --> 33:26.680
so you do still remember the Crown Prince.

764
33:28.720 --> 33:30.160
Meng Rui has really

765
33:30.920 --> 33:32.980
stirred up a hornet's nest this time.

766
33:33.720 --> 33:35.350
The court and Northern Kun

767
33:35.350 --> 33:37.750
would love nothing more than to tear him limb from limb.

768
33:37.750 --> 33:38.960
And you?

769
33:39.480 --> 33:41.400
You went and let him escape.

770
33:42.000 --> 33:43.060
Do you have any idea

771
33:43.720 --> 33:46.830
how much trouble you've caused the Crown Prince?

772
33:49.750 --> 33:52.010
That's what Xiao Ning told you, isn't it?

773
33:56.830 --> 33:57.590
Eunuch Zhao,

774
33:57.590 --> 33:59.590
Xiao Ning is the First Prince's man.

775
33:59.790 --> 34:01.120
How can the Crown Prince

776
34:01.160 --> 34:02.640
take his word for it?

777
34:03.480 --> 34:04.750
That day, the Ministry of Justice

778
34:04.750 --> 34:07.480
and the Divine Constable Bureau were both there.

779
34:07.960 --> 34:09.960
Even if they had captured Meng Rui on the spot,

780
34:09.960 --> 34:12.400
it wouldn't have counted as the Crown Prince's achievement.

781
34:12.400 --> 34:13.190
But what if

782
34:13.760 --> 34:14.960
I were to bring Meng Rui

783
34:14.960 --> 34:15.960
back on my own?

784
34:17.230 --> 34:18.070
You?

785
34:18.960 --> 34:19.920
Are you saying

786
34:19.920 --> 34:21.510
you know where Meng Rui is?

787
34:23.000 --> 34:24.920
Forty or fifty thousand people

788
34:24.920 --> 34:27.320
across Tianhuang City are looking for him.

789
34:28.320 --> 34:29.980
And you think you can find him?

790
34:34.590 --> 34:35.920
There is only one kind of person

791
34:35.920 --> 34:37.000
in this world

792
34:37.000 --> 34:38.030
whom I can't find.

793
34:41.360 --> 34:43.230
Someone who has lost themselves.

794
34:44.670 --> 34:45.580
Unless they

795
34:46.190 --> 34:47.360
find themselves,

796
34:48.150 --> 34:49.550
no one else can find them.

797
34:52.710 --> 34:54.170
But Meng Rui is different.

798
34:54.710 --> 34:56.000
He's the kind of person

799
34:56.020 --> 34:57.960
who would never lose his way, no matter what.

800
34:57.960 --> 34:59.150
Someone like him?

801
35:00.000 --> 35:01.030
I'd find him

802
35:02.360 --> 35:04.160
even if he were reduced to ashes.

803
35:09.190 --> 35:11.110
Young Master Qingyang,

804
35:14.710 --> 35:19.230
I hope your actions prove even better than your words.

805
35:25.150 --> 35:25.960
However,

806
35:26.710 --> 35:27.710
there's one more thing

807
35:27.710 --> 35:29.710
I'd like to ask your advice on.

808
35:31.110 --> 35:31.920
Go ahead.

809
35:34.510 --> 35:37.190
The Ministry of War is in the Crown Prince's hands.

810
35:37.190 --> 35:39.510
With Prince Wenbu dead, the Ministry of War stands to gain.

811
35:39.510 --> 35:41.150
Does the Crown Prince truly want

812
35:41.150 --> 35:43.150
the Divine Constable Bureau to bring the real murderer to justice?

813
35:43.150 --> 35:45.150
Li Qingyang, have you lost your mind?

814
35:45.150 --> 35:46.710
How dare you drag the Crown Prince into this?

815
35:46.710 --> 35:47.440
You—

816
35:49.710 --> 35:50.590
Eunuch Zhao,

817
35:51.150 --> 35:52.590
I didn't say anything.

818
35:53.280 --> 35:54.960
You're the one shouting.

819
35:58.150 --> 35:59.810
You nearly scared me to death.

820
36:00.180 --> 36:01.020
Li Qingyang,

821
36:01.590 --> 36:02.830
don't you dare

822
36:03.410 --> 36:05.300
say things like that again.

823
36:08.360 --> 36:09.150
Eunuch Zhao,

824
36:11.190 --> 36:13.250
could it be that you're not so certain

825
36:13.590 --> 36:15.360
about this matter either?

826
36:16.030 --> 36:16.990
What if

827
36:17.710 --> 36:19.480
I bring the real murderer back,

828
36:20.000 --> 36:21.960
only for it to work against the Crown Prince?

829
36:21.960 --> 36:22.710
Impossible.

830
36:23.390 --> 36:25.760
Absolutely impossible.

831
36:32.040 --> 36:34.130
Whether it's the First Prince's reaction

832
36:34.130 --> 36:36.020
or Eunuch Zhao's,

833
36:36.150 --> 36:37.760
it seems Prince Wenbu's death

834
36:37.760 --> 36:38.440
really

835
36:38.440 --> 36:40.500
has nothing to do with either of them.

836
36:40.710 --> 36:42.670
With Northern Kun's army bearing down on us,

837
36:42.670 --> 36:44.480
besides the Ministry of War and the Ministry of Revenue,

838
36:44.480 --> 36:46.360
who else stands to benefit?

839
37:03.070 --> 37:05.550
A master like Yan Zige

840
37:06.020 --> 37:07.530
would surely have

841
37:08.110 --> 37:11.910
inner power protecting his vital points during a fight to the death.

842
37:11.920 --> 37:13.450
How could Meng Rui's strike

843
37:13.480 --> 37:14.920
have possibly

844
37:14.920 --> 37:16.580
ruptured his heart meridian?

845
38:10.840 --> 38:11.630
Right.

846
38:11.960 --> 38:14.420
Meng Rui treasures that sword of his so much.

847
38:14.710 --> 38:16.900
He must be making a new scabbard

848
38:17.280 --> 38:19.070
for the Severe-Cold Sword.
